{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-20","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：平面与角","englishTitle":"If a solid angle be contained by three plane angles, any two, taken together in any manner, are greater than the remaining one.","book":11,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","contentId":"euclid-11-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7452763c6d06bcae4859a56707bab714938fad3cad98fa2c77d8d322d15c00c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-20.statement","euclid-11-20.construction.1","euclid-11-20.proof.1","euclid-11-20.proof.2","euclid-11-20.proof.3","euclid-11-20.proof.4","euclid-11-20.proof.5","euclid-11-20.proof.6","euclid-11-20.proof.7","euclid-11-20.conclusion","euclid-11-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3828eb9461df2ed274913486a38f8a4cc0799009de8ca271505740d433936b23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a solid angle be contained by three plane angles, any two, taken together in any manner, are greater than the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个立体角度由三个平面角度组成,那么以任何方式组合在一起的任何两个角度都大于其余的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0203a87912ed085fa64a9d0db2ec717a00f9b25fecbe7d564415d73d12e3e7db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the solid angle at A be contained by the three plane angles BAC, CAD, DAB; I say that any two of the angles BAC, CAD, DAB, taken together in any manner, are greater than the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A的立体角度由3 平面角度BAC、CAD、DAB组成;我说,任何两个角度,无论以何种方式加在一起,都大于其余两个角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93290a4aa760bf0002fc0cec101d11e5f486537b013452b49d0315c2e8327a0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If now the angles BAC, CAD, DAB are equal to one another, it is manifest that any two are greater than the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果现在的角度BAC,CAD,DAB是等同的,那么显然任何两个角度都大于其余两个角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a1e09edd88272972e22acb309f2ce2238a34e0f4c513beccdcd0bce2d31cb82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, let BAC be greater, and on the straight line AB, and at the point A on it, let the angle BAE be constructed, in the plane through BA, AC, equal to the angle DAB; let AE be made equal to AD, and let BEC, drawn across through the point E, cut the straight lines AB, AC at the points B, C; let DB, DC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,则要扩大BAC,在AB直线上,在A直线上,让BAE角(平面至BA、AC角)等于DAB角;AE角等于AD,让BEC线通过E线,在B、C点切断AB、AC直线;DB、DC连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b638974bb2cfe886b386efbb25fa000252209f4033991dfa9826dbb870bbbdc","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DA is equal to AE, and AB is common, two sides are equal to two sides; and the angle DAB is equal to the angle BAE; therefore the base DB is equal to the base BE. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于DA等于AE,AB是共同的,两边等于两边;角度DAB等于角度BAE;因此,角度底边 DB等于角度底边 BE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14d7bffd6a29be61762b851f245f7de8b47269ec442a3520fe3a811109334e5d","citations":["euclid-1-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides BD, DC are greater than BC, [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)] and of these DB was proved equal to BE, therefore the remainder DC is greater than the remainder EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方BD,DC超过BC,其中DB被证明等于BE,因此其余DC大于其余EC。 [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a653bcb87e22332ef203011657c0c2dc5454de5f9883426eb20a684c3d26e8de","citations":["euclid-1-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DA is equal to AE, and AC is common, and the base DC is greater than the base EC, therefore the angle DAC is greater than the angle EAC. [[I. 25](/principles/euclid-1-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,DA等于AE,AC是常见的,底边 DC大于底边 EC,因此,角度DAC大于角度EAC。 [[I. 25](/principles/euclid-1-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc47c7d37cd4cde14ebc05586819068cfec0a91f1fb54a5333881c83e1ac2253","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle DAB was also proved equal to the angle BAE; therefore the angles DAB, DAC are greater than the angle BAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DAB角度也证明等于BAE角度;因此,DAB,DAC角度大于BAC角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dce0f6a5ebdff7be8c99b827953fda4b3a1049faac66c857a16c232cb18669e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the remaining angles also, taken together two and two, are greater than the remaining one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,剩余的两个角度加起来,也大于其余的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-20.source","contentId":"euclid-11-20","revisionId":"euclid-11-20@raw-b7452763c6d06bca","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfd551ce1df45dc417e8b5b430f2c4fc94807d4ecf17080cf4fc6c739addb521","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-20:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-20.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-20:euclid-1-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-20.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"I. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-20:euclid-1-